# Two-agent workflow

After any implementation, the **parent** (this chat) invokes the `reviewer` subagent on the real git diff. The `developer` agent must not start a review.

The reviewer must apply `.cursor/rules/code-quality.mdc` (readability, reusable components, colocated tests, ESLint).

Do not commit or push unless Gabriel explicitly asks.

Do not treat the reviewer as a merge gate. Present its findings and wait for his review.
